         Round 8 mnemonic 2026-05-24: paired with the engine's bare
         period/comma (NextUnit/PrevUnit). Bare = "next unit needing
         orders" (engine's ready-to-select gate). Shift = "include
         all units regardless of orders state" (our cycle-all
         override). Same key family, direction matches engine's
         (period=forward, comma=back). Both Shift+./, are unbound in
         vanilla InputConfiguration.xml — no engine collision.
         Previously bare N / Shift+N (round 7); changed once the
         Shift+./, free-gesture check confirmed the better mnemonic.
         See [[reference_engine_action_dual_dispatch_breaks_audio]]
         for why we avoided Ctrl+./,. -->
